  "solution": {
    "text": "If the given system of equations has no solution. then $\\left|\\begin{array}{ccc}2 & -1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & \\lambda\\end{array}\\right|=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow 2(-2 \\lambda-1)+1(\\lambda-1)-2(1+2)=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad-4 \\lambda-2+\\lambda-1-6=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad-3 \\lambda-9=0$\r\n$\\Rightarrow \\quad \\lambda=-3$",
